      <p begin="00:40.210" end="00:41.710" ttm:agent="v1">Move yo body</p>
      <p begin="00:41.160" end="00:42.980" ttm:agent="v1">First of all let's go to work</p>
      <p begin="00:42.980" end="00:45.290" ttm:agent="v1">Back it up hop in reverse</p>
      <p begin="00:45.290" end="00:46.790" ttm:agent="v1">She'll eat it up for a berk</p>
      <p begin="00:46.770" end="00:48.500" ttm:agent="v1">And then, still leave some room for dessert</p>
      <p begin="00:48.500" end="00:50.230" ttm:agent="v1">Girl, try not to move your body</p>
      <p begin="00:50.230" end="00:52.310" ttm:agent="v1">I put in work like a colleague</p>
      <p begin="00:52.310" end="00:54.110" ttm:agent="v1">She popped a squat like an Ollie</p>
      <p begin="00:54.110" end="00:55.880" ttm:agent="v1">Then things got totally gnarly</p>
      <p begin="00:55.880" end="00:57.600" ttm:agent="v1">So hotty, like Scotty</p>
      <p begin="00:57.600" end="00:59.450" ttm:agent="v1">Want to party all night like Miley</p>
      <p begin="00:59.450" end="01:01.250" ttm:agent="v1">Say she like bad boys Mike Lowry</p>
      <p begin="01:01.250" end="01:03.150" ttm:agent="v1">Watch me put her on cam icarly</p>
      <p begin="01:03.150" end="01:04.750" ttm:agent="v1">I like ranch but I'm stacking blue cheese</p>
      <p begin="01:04.750" end="01:06.590" ttm:agent="v1">It's not a person who could stop me, wemby</p>
      <p begin="01:06.590" end="01:08.320" ttm:agent="v1">I don't fear no man just test me</p>
      <p begin="01:08.320" end="01:10.430" ttm:agent="v1">Gather up the whole gang like one piece</p>
